abstract: >-
  RoninForge Tsuba is a project scaffolder for Claude Code skills, plugins,
  hooks, and agents that generates marketplace-ready directories, then hands the
  result to RoninForge Hanko for validation before submission. It ships as a Go
  command-line tool and a GitHub Action, is MIT licensed, runs entirely on your
  machine, and requires no API keys.
